window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In \"<i>Forbidden Obsession</i>,\" the first “book” of an exciting trilogy,<br> we meet Rose, a 22-year-old bartender<br> longing for something extraordinary in her life.<br> After a shift, she takes her usual shortcut<br> home through a dimly lit alley<br> and encounters a mysterious masked man,<br> igniting a mix of fear and curiosity.<br> <br> This man, later known as Xade, captivates Rose and<br> challenges her understanding of love.<br> As their relationship deepens,<br> she discovers his complexities and<br> realizes that love can be both beautiful and dangerous.<br> <br> The story explores love's raw nature as Rose<br> navigates trust, loyalty, and the consequences of her choices.<br> Each chapter immerses listeners in a world of<br> romance and suspense, raising the stakes<br> with every decision.<br> <br> Ultimately, \"<i>Forbidden Obsession</i>\" reflects the resilience<br> of the human spirit and the quest for connection. As Rose's journey<br> unfolds amidst love and obsession, listeners will ponder the risks of love<br> and the pursuit of happiness.<br> <br> This gripping novella promises to keep listeners engaged<br> as they follow Rose and Xade's tumultuous path.</p>"; 
